      "value": "Break"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I can focus my magic to break things. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Dirt, Stone, and more all shatters at my command",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". I can feel the earth shake below my feet. \n\nIf I put more effort into the spell to "
        },
        {
          "text": "increase its magnitude, I can increase what it can break",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nI've heard rumors that there are "
        },
        {
          "text": "magic rings that can do this for me as well",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". I should check back when I've gained some experience."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
